105 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (It is such a privilege to have each of you here today.  Today I am reminded that every woman carries a unique story, a purpose, and a potential that deserves to be nurtured. Yet, in the busyness of building careers, caring for others, pursuing our dreams, and meeting the expectations placed upon us, we can sometimes forget to extend that same grace and patience to ourselves. Today is a gentle reminder that you do not have to be in full bloom to be growing beautifully.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
106 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (Nature teaches us that every season has a purpose. There are seasons of planting, seasons of waiting, seasons of pruning, and seasons of flourishing. In the same way, our lives will not always look the same. There will be moments when we feel confident and accomplished, and others when we are uncertain, stretched, or beginning again. Neither season diminishes our worth. Even when growth is invisible to the eye, something meaningful may still be taking place within us.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
107 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (Ecclesiastes 3:1 reminds us:)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
