<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E <8D546F206576657279207468696E67207468657265206973206120736561736F6E2C20616E6420612074696D6520746F20657665727920707572706F736520756E646572207468652068656176656E2E8E2084204563636C657369617374657320333A3120284B4A5629>
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
109 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (As you journey through today, I encourage you to give yourself permission to embrace the season you are in. Celebrate how far you have come, be gentle with the woman you are becoming, and remain hopeful about all that is still ahead of you. Do not measure your journey against another woman's timeline. Her bloom does not diminish yours, and your journey does not have to look like anyone else's to be meaningful.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
110 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (At WOW, our heart is to create spaces where women can be encouraged, equipped, inspired, and reminded that their growth matters, not only professionally, but personally, emotionally, and spiritually. We believe that when women are supported and empowered to grow with purpose, they become better equipped to make a meaningful difference in their families, workplaces, communities, and the world.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
111 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (My prayer is that you leave today with more than beautiful memories. May you leave with renewed courage, meaningful connections, fresh perspective, and the confidence to keep becoming the woman you were created to be.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
